      "label": "C",
      "text": "\\(39\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "D",
      "text": "\\(43\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "E",
      "text": "\\(49\\)"
    }
  ],
  "answer": {
    "letter": "b",
    "value": "37"
  },
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-8-2020-p4.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The first three hexagons contain \\(1,\\) \\(7,\\) and \\(19\\) dots. Each new band adds \\(6\\) more dots than the previous band.\n\nThe fourth hexagon adds \\(18\\) dots around the third hexagon, so it contains \\(19+18=37\\) dots.\n\nThus, the correct answer is B.",
      "hints": [
        "The added bands have \\(6,\\) \\(12,\\) \\(18,\\) \\(\\ldots\\) dots",
        "The next hexagon is the third one plus the next band"
      ],
